invariant: INV-17
file: src/chacha20.c
catches: chacha20_wipe_test
reason: chacha20_block returns without the wipe of the stack below it, so
  the dead frames of its body keep the state, whose words 4 to 11 are the
  key. aead.c keys Poly1305 through it for every message. Every block it
  writes is still right. bin/chacha20_wipe_test copies the stack below a
  call and looks for the key.

--- old
    block_body(key, nonce, counter, out);
    wipe_frame_call();
--- new
    block_body(key, nonce, counter, out);
